Description: control center for Mechrevo and Tongfang laptops
 OpenRevo drives the EC, keyboard lighting, fan curves, pause and battery
 limits of Mechrevo/Tongfang laptops through the sysfs kernel interfaces
 (tongfang-mifs-wmi hwmon, platform_profile, the kbd_backlight LED) and falls
 back to direct EC access through ec_sys and the ACPI ports.
 .
 This build targets Wayland and X11 desktops and only uses freedesktop
 services: StatusNotifier for the tray, logind for sleep events, polkit for
 the privileged EC fallback, and the XDG base directories.
